{"id":"a8a0a7253619eec2","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process.md","title":"ZFC Prob Brownian Motion Process","display":"df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process — ZFC Prob Brownian Motion Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process — ZFC Prob Brownian Motion Process","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-prob3-stochastic-process.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-random-variables.md]]","[[58-df-gaussian.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-brownian-motion-process — ZFC Prob Brownian Motion Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c0965aa19af9708d\" href=\"?note=c0965aa19af9708d\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-prob3-stochastic-process.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-prob3-stochastic-process.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"63aa415026d55abe\" href=\"?note=63aa415026d55abe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-random-variables.md\">58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-random-variables.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c96eb70b5fd08810\" href=\"?note=c96eb70b5fd08810\" title=\"58-df-gaussian.md\">58-df-gaussian.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega_0,\\Delta,\\vec t,n\\in V\">\\(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega_0,\\Delta,\\vec t,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span> is the Borel sigma-algebra</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\">\\(\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\)</span> (epsilon-delta path-continuity predicate defined below)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\)</span> (finite increment-family predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StochasticProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StochasticProcess}_S\\)</span> (typing predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S\\)</span> (independent-family predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}path} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|B(s)(\\omega_0)-B(t)(\\omega_0)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}path} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(|s-t|&lt;\\delta\\to|B(s)(\\omega_0)-B(t)(\\omega_0)|&lt;\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StochasticProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),B)\\land\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid B(0)(\\omega_0)=0\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid B(0)(\\omega_0)=0\\})=1\\land\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\})=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\forall k&lt;n\\;(\\vec t(k)&lt;\\vec t(k+1))\\bigr]\\to\\exists\\Delta\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\;(\\Delta(k)(\\omega_0)=B(\\vec t(k))(\\omega_0)-B(\\vec t(k-1))(\\omega_0))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\operatorname{Gaussian}_S(\\Delta(k);0,\\vec t(k)-\\vec t(k-1);\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StochasticProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),B)\\land\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid B(0)(\\omega_0)=0\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid B(0)(\\omega_0)=0\\})=1\\land\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\})=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\forall k&lt;n\\;(\\vec t(k)&lt;\\vec t(k+1))\\bigr]\\to\\exists\\Delta\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\;(\\Delta(k)(\\omega_0)=B(\\vec t(k))(\\omega_0)-B(\\vec t(k-1))(\\omega_0))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\operatorname{Gaussian}_S(\\Delta(k);0,\\vec t(k)-\\vec t(k-1);\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The almost-sure events are set comprehensions rather than undeclared abbreviations. Each time vector explicitly witnesses a function-valued increment family before independence and Gaussianity are asserted.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-prob3-stochastic-process.md","status":"resolved","id":"c0965aa19af9708d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-prob3-stochastic-process.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-random-variables.md","status":"resolved","id":"63aa415026d55abe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob3-independent-random-variables.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-gaussian.md","status":"resolved","id":"c96eb70b5fd08810","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-gaussian.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\omega_0,\\Delta,\\vec t,n\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StochasticProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}continuous\\text{-}path} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\leftrightarrow\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(|s-t|<\\delta\\to|B(s)(\\omega_0)-B(t)(\\omega_0)|<\\varepsilon\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}brownian\\text{-}motion\\text{-}process} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProbBrownianMotionProcess}_S(B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3StochasticProcess}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R),B)\\land\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid B(0)(\\omega_0)=0\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid B(0)(\\omega_0)=0\\})=1\\land\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mathbb P(\\{\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\mid\\mathrm{ContinuousPath}_S(B,\\omega_0)\\})=1\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\forall\\vec t\\in(\\mathbb R_{\\geq0})^{n+1}\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\forall k<n\\;(\\vec t(k)<\\vec t(k+1))\\bigr]\\to\\exists\\Delta\\;\\bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\forall\\omega_0\\in\\Omega\\;(\\Delta(k)(\\omega_0)=B(\\vec t(k))(\\omega_0)-B(\\vec t(k-1))(\\omega_0))\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb3IndependentRandomVariables}_S(\\Delta,\\{1,\\ldots,n\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R))\\land\\forall k\\in\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\;\\operatorname{Gaussian}_S(\\Delta(k);0,\\vec t(k)-\\vec t(k-1);\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\bigr]\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":3022,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0bca8961c66270